  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #333399;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Report on\nCONSTITUTION DAY-2025</span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Indian Constitution ay was celebrated on 26th Nov-2025 at ATME College of engineering, Mysuru, around 1500 Stude ts a ong with the Faculty members of the College took the pledge on Preamble of Indian Constitution to uphold the values of constitution and to be a constructive citizen for the development of the country.</p>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Constitution-day.pdf\" data-wp-editing=\"1\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">DOWNLOAD&nbsp; REPORT</span>[/caption]",
